---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif mb-6">Privacy Notice</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p>This website collects information submitted through the "Get Involved" and "Tell us how you have used FAIR" forms to understand the reach and impact of the FAIR Nursing Study.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect your name, role, organisation, email address, and details of how you have used FAIR.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use this information to evaluate the reach and impact of the study and to contact you for further information where you have given us permission to do so. Our lawful basis for processing is legitimate interests (impact evaluation of research).</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">Retention</h2>
      <p>Information submitted through forms will normally be retained for up to five years to allow us to monitor and evaluate the longer term reach and impact of FAIR.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif mt-8 mb-4">Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can contact us if you would like to ask about the personal information we hold about you, request that inaccurate information is corrected, or raise a concern about how your information is being used.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>